 Reads boards/<name>/board.json and the CSV file it names ("data", relative to the board's folder) and writes
 boards/<name>/index.html. Rows are grouped into sections by the "section" field and ordered by the earliest date
 in each section; sections whose date has passed go under one fold at the bottom.
+
+Optional board.json settings (the tasks board uses them; the events board doesn't):
+  section without "date"  sections are not dated: the one for a blank field ("empty" label) comes first, then A-Z
+  "sort": field           order rows inside each section by that date field
+  "done_label": label     rows whose status is done go under one fold with that label at the bottom
+  "rota": {...}           a list of weeks and who has each, at the top ("week", "who", "label", "empty")
+  column "date": true     show the value as a date, flagged overdue / this week unless the row is done
+  column "prefix": text   put text in front of the value, e.g. "with " for who a task is waiting on
